# dexMonitor — Snapshot Log (raw API; UI panel moved to Grafana's Snapshot pipeline dashboard)

### Snapshot Log — last 50 entries (default)
# Returns: [{ id, timestamp, exchanges: { <name>: { count, ids: [] } }, offers_count }]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot-log

###

### Snapshot Log — more entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot-log?limit=200
